{"documentCount":17,"nextId":17,"documentIds":{"0":"about-me/","1":"about-me/#about-me","2":"about-me/#about-me-who-am-i","3":"about-me/#about-me-what-am-i-doing-currently","4":"about-me/#about-me-what-are-my-hobbies","5":"booklet/","6":"booklet/#booklet","7":"booklet/#booklet-booklet","8":"booklet/#booklet-vocabulary-list","9":"brainstorm/","10":"brainstorm/#brainstorm","11":"brainstorm/#brainstorm-situation","12":"brainstorm/#brainstorm-brainstorming-and-background-info","13":"/","14":"/#english-portfolio","15":"summer-2026/","16":"summer-2026/#summer-2026"},"fieldIds":{"title":0,"headings":1,"text":2},"fieldLength":{"0":[2,11,57],"1":[3,2,1],"2":[6,3,1],"3":[8,5,1],"4":[7,4,1],"5":[1,3,11],"6":[2,1,1],"7":[2,1,1],"8":[4,2,1],"9":[1,7,178],"10":[2,1,1],"11":[4,2,1],"12":[7,5,1],"13":[2,2,8],"14":[3,2,1],"15":[2,2,24],"16":[3,2,1]},"averageFieldLength":[3.4705882352941178,3.235294117647059,17.058823529411764],"storedFields":{"0":{"title":"About Me","id":"about-me/","text":"About Me\n\nPortfolio Entry #1: Website’s “About Me” section + Summer Updates.\nWho am I\nI am a appretice at Rafisa Informatik learning app development.\nWhat am I doing currently\nIm have been developing a apprentice capacity managing website in a team.\nIm also working on a Java api for the internal database as lead dev.\nWhat are my hobbies\nI like to skate and play pool.\n"},"1":{"title":"About Me > About Me","id":"about-me/#about-me","text":""},"2":{"title":"About Me > Who am I","id":"about-me/#about-me-who-am-i","text":""},"3":{"title":"About Me > What am I doing currently","id":"about-me/#about-me-what-am-i-doing-currently","text":""},"4":{"title":"About Me > What are my hobbies","id":"about-me/#about-me-what-are-my-hobbies","text":""},"5":{"title":"Booklet","id":"booklet/","text":"Booklet\nHere is my Booklet and the vocabulary list.\nBooklet\n\nVocabulary List\n"},"6":{"title":"Booklet > Booklet","id":"booklet/#booklet","text":""},"7":{"title":"Booklet > Booklet","id":"booklet/#booklet-booklet","text":""},"8":{"title":"Booklet > Vocabulary List","id":"booklet/#booklet-vocabulary-list","text":""},"9":{"title":"Brainstorm","id":"brainstorm/","text":"Brainstorm\n25/08/2026\n\n\nSituation:\nYou are a second-year apprentice who is about to move to another department in your (real) company. Your superior gave you the task to create a booklet for the apprentice who is about to take over your job. Start thinking about the various tasks you do at work, which ones you like, and realistically, which ones could be put in this learning documentation.\n\nBrainstorming and background info:\n\nWhat’s the name of your company?\n\nRafisa\n\n\nWhat’s your current department?\n\nIT\n\n\nWhat tasks do you carry out on a regular basis?\n\nComunicate with others, code features, refactor code, document code, experiment\n\n\nWhich of these is a complex task?\n\nCoding features is the most complex task\n\n\nWhy do you like or dislike doing this task?\n\nI like it when I learn something I can use for me personaly\n\n\nHow do you manage this complex task?\n\nI use AI for research and when I dont understand the code.\nI ask others for help.\n\n\nHow can you organise clear and effective explanations of a complex task for your classmate?\n\nI like to talk to peaple in person and use documentation.\n\n\nWhat are the dos and the don’ts with regard to this task?\n\nDos\nBe sure all the details are agreed upon so you\ndon’t have to redo or undo what you have coded.\n\n\nDon’ts\nHesitate asking question\n\n\nWhat issues would you have to deal with if you forgot an essential step of your complex task?\n\nIf there is no clear vision, people will never say if a task is actually finished.\nIf there is a library already accesable for you Task use that instead of making things manualy.\n\n\nWhat skills do you need to complete these tasks?\n\nTalk to people, look for alternatives.\n\n\nStart to list below some specific vocabular terms you need to know to do the various tasks at your work:\n\nRefactor, Sprint Retro, Style, Merge Request\n\n\n\n"},"10":{"title":"Brainstorm > Brainstorm","id":"brainstorm/#brainstorm","text":""},"11":{"title":"Brainstorm > Situation:","id":"brainstorm/#brainstorm-situation","text":""},"12":{"title":"Brainstorm > Brainstorming and background info:","id":"brainstorm/#brainstorm-brainstorming-and-background-info","text":""},"13":{"title":"English Portfolio","id":"/","text":"English Portfolio\nThis is my english portfolio.\n"},"14":{"title":"English Portfolio > English Portfolio","id":"/#english-portfolio","text":""},"15":{"title":"Summer 2026","id":"summer-2026/","text":"Summer 2026\n\nThis Summer i went to the Königssee in Bavaria.\nHere are some Photos i took.\nThese are encoded in AVIF and converted from DNG 24BIT.\n\n\n"},"16":{"title":"Summer 2026 > Summer 2026","id":"summer-2026/#summer-2026","text":""}},"dirtCount":0,"index":[["königssee",{"2":{"15":1}}],["know",{"2":{"9":1}}],["need",{"2":{"9":2}}],["never",{"2":{"9":1}}],["no",{"2":{"9":1}}],["name",{"2":{"9":1}}],["question",{"2":{"9":1}}],["undo",{"2":{"9":1}}],["understand",{"2":{"9":1}}],["upon",{"2":{"9":1}}],["updates",{"2":{"0":1}}],["use",{"2":{"9":4}}],["encoded",{"2":{"15":1}}],["english",{"0":{"13":1,"14":2},"1":{"13":1,"14":1},"2":{"13":2}}],["entry",{"2":{"0":1}}],["essential",{"2":{"9":1}}],["explanations",{"2":{"9":1}}],["experiment",{"2":{"9":1}}],["effective",{"2":{"9":1}}],["from",{"2":{"15":1}}],["finished",{"2":{"9":1}}],["features",{"2":{"9":2}}],["forgot",{"2":{"9":1}}],["for",{"2":{"0":1,"9":7}}],["vocabular",{"2":{"9":1}}],["vocabulary",{"0":{"8":1},"1":{"5":1,"8":1},"2":{"5":2}}],["vision",{"2":{"9":1}}],["various",{"2":{"9":2}}],["job",{"2":{"9":1}}],["java",{"2":{"0":1}}],["organise",{"2":{"9":1}}],["or",{"2":{"9":2}}],["others",{"2":{"9":2}}],["out",{"2":{"9":1}}],["of",{"2":{"9":5}}],["over",{"2":{"9":1}}],["ones",{"2":{"9":2}}],["on",{"2":{"0":1,"9":1}}],["gave",{"2":{"9":1}}],["request",{"2":{"9":1}}],["retro",{"2":{"9":1}}],["redo",{"